{
  "public_post": "Urgent update: The flour batch used this week was contaminated; all co‑op bread is unsafe. Do NOT eat any loaves, return them for a full refund, and we will halt sales for the rest of the week. Compensation will be provided to anyone who fell ill.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Immediate full recall of every loaf sold this week; stop all baking today; process refunds and free‑loaf vouchers for sick residents; coordinate with health officials; schedule an emergency meeting at 10 AM tomorrow to plan a safe resumption on day 6.",
  "reason": "To correct misinformation, protect villagers' health, and maintain trust."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All bread sold by the co‑op this week is contaminated and may cause illness. We are recalling every loaf, issuing full refunds, and providing a free‑loaf voucher to each resident. No bread will be sold today or for the remainder of the week while we secure a certified safe flour supply.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Initiate immediate full recall of every loaf sold this week, process refunds, and coordinate medical assistance for anyone who fell ill. Halt all production until we have a certified safe flour supplier. Prepare a compensation plan: free‑loaf vouchers for all residents next week and additional support for affected families.",
  "reason": "To correct contradictory public messages, protect residents' health, and coordinate a full recall and compensation."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important: All bread sold this week was contaminated; we have issued full refunds and free‑loaf vouchers to anyone who fell ill. No co‑op bread will be sold tomorrow, and we will resume sales next week with certified safe flour. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Confirm that every refund and free‑loaf voucher has been processed; schedule an emergency meeting at 9 AM tomorrow to secure a certified safe flour supplier and finalize the plan to reopen on day 1 of next week; prepare the resident communication and inventory for the restart.",
  "reason": "We must close the week, ensure compensation, and coordinate a safe resumption of sales."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important update: No co‑op bread will be sold today or until we have a certified safe flour supply. All refunds have been issued and every resident will receive a free‑loaf voucher for next week. If you are feeling ill, please see the clinic. We will announce the resumption date as soon as possible. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Confirm that all refunds and vouchers have been sent; finalise contract with a certified safe flour supplier (expected delivery day 8); schedule a meeting at 9 AM tomorrow to plan a safe restart and implement new quality‑control checks; prepare inventory for next week’s distribution.",
  "reason": "To inform residents of the continued halt and compensation, and to coordinate final recall steps and safe resumption with co‑op members."
}
